  "body": "Hey folks, I read that record type keys [must be](https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#idl-record) one of DOMString, USVString, or ByteString. Would it be possible to consider `unsigned short` as well or is there another way to think about this?\r\n\r\nHere's what I'd like to implement.\r\n\r\n```idl\r\ndictionary Foo {\r\n  ...\r\n  record<unsigned short, Bar> someName;\r\n}; \r\n\r\ndictionary Bar {\r\n  BufferSource someSource;\r\n  BufferSource anotherSource;\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\nThanks in advance,\r\nFrancois.",
